adr: 0357
file: selfhost/apfront.pas
kills: dump-symbols_task
why: The outline writes `procedure` for a task again, which is the word it wrote for every nkProcDecl that was not a function until this record. A task is started by spawn and cannot be called, so the word sends a reader to the wrong construct; the dumps case pins the row.
--- old
    else if d^.pdIsTask then write('task')
--- new
    else if d^.pdIsTask then write('procedure')
